{"meta":{"id":"tt0240772","type":"movie","name":"La Gran Estafa","description":"Danny Ocean es un carismático ladrón que, tan sólo 24 horas después de cumplir una larga condena en prisión, ya está planeando su próximo delito. Su objetivo: realizar el mayor atraco de casinos de la historia. Para ello formará un equipo de once hombres, cada uno de ellos el mejor en su campo. Sin embargo surgirá un problema inesperado: el dueño de los locales, Terry Benedic, está saliendo con Tess, su ex-mujer.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/fxLINgpYDDRDljEn3ukKhOcvZdw.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ncoqdHs1poUaBqyKic9YI8ai7MP.jpg","logo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/p8OAQOQWdTjuGsBJCleal3n6Bfk.png","genres":["Suspense","Crimen"],"releaseInfo":"2001","released":"2001-12-07T00:00:00.000Z","imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"116 min","trailers":[{"source":"n3epi9hPbqQ","type":"Trailer"}],"cast":["George Clooney","Brad Pitt","Andy Garcia","Matt Damon","Julia Roberts","Casey Affleck","Scott Caan","Don Cheadle","Elliott Gould","Eddie Jemison","Bernie Mac","Shaobo Qin","Carl Reiner","Cecelia Ann Birt","Paul L. Nolan"],"director":["Steven Soderbergh"],"writer":["Ted Griffin"],"links":[{"name":"George Clooney","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=George%20Clooney"},{"name":"Brad Pitt","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Brad%20Pitt"},{"name":"Andy Garcia","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Andy%20Garcia"},{"name":"Matt Damon","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Matt%20Damon"},{"name":"Julia Roberts","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Julia%20Roberts"},{"name":"Casey Affleck","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Casey%20Affleck"},{"name":"Scott Caan","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Scott%20Caan"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=Don%20Cheadle"},{"name":"Elliott Gould","category":"Cast","url":"stremio:///search?search=E